OL,3,GNEWSATrain delays after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto level crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains in Worcestershire are facing
OL,7,Fdelays after a car crashed into a level
OL,8,Fcrossing barrier, according to West
OL,9,FMidlands Railway (WMR).
OL,11,FThe incident happened at a crossing at
OL,12,FStocks Lane, Leigh Sinton - between
OL,13,FWorcester Foregate Street and Great
OL,14,FMalvern - at 10:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said a
OL,17,Fwoman was treated at the scene by
OL,18,Fparamedics before being taken to
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
