OL,3,GNEWSATrain delays after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto level crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer injuries are not thought to be
OL,7,Fserious. As a result of the crash, all
OL,8,Ftrains will start or terminate at
OL,9,Feither Worcester Foregate Street or
OL,10,FShrub Hill.
